|en
|year=1996
|author=Andrew W. Conrad; Alma Rubal-Lopez
|title=Post-Imperial English: Status Change in Former British and American Colonies, 1940-1990
|publisher=Walter de Gruyter
|isbn=9783110872187
|page=343
|passage=Just before independence (in 1955) the military garrison in the '''south''' rebelled and that was the beginning of a civil war between the north and the '''south'''&nbsp;...}}
